      "latex": "Identification ranges in the retained sixteen-city, ten-indicator matrix.\nEight of the eleven fully unknown entries concern upper-secondary pupil--teacher\nratios. Shading shows utility upper minus lower bounds; dots mark retained point\nassumptions and question marks identify $[0,1]$ entries. Point assumptions include\nsubmitted values and do not certify independent validation or zero measurement\nerror. These are identification bounds under the retained source rules, not\nconfidence intervals. Travel entries retain school-travel and general-commute proxy scopes. Cities follow the input order. Source: V197 utility bounds."
